    "intro_html":  "Pork braised low and slow in tomatoes and mirepoix until it shreds with a look, then piled over ribbons of pasta. Sounds like a $30 trattoria plate; it is actually \u003cstrong\u003eabout $2.07 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost) with \u003cstrong\u003e37 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and 578 calories. Time does the work, and time is free.",
